cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Posnic POS in research, cite the exact release or commit you
  evaluated together with these project metadata.
title: Posnic POS
type: software
abstract: >-
  Posnic POS is zero-price, offline-first point-of-sale software for retail
  shops and restaurants. Posnic's own source is AGPL-3.0-only. Release packages
  include separately licensed components, including MongoDB Community Server
  under SSPL-1.0. Its primary API and database run on the shop computer, with
  optional external payment, cloud, and integration dependencies.
authors:
  - name: Posnic Innovations Private Limited
repository-code: https://github.com/Posnic/POS
url: https://posnic.com/
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 1.5.0
keywords:
  - point of sale
  - POS software
  - offline-first
  - retail
  - restaurant
  - inventory management
  - billing software
